[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m```text[m
[32m+[m[32mduofocus/[m
[32m+[m[32m├── frontend/   # React + Vite + TypeScript[m
[32m+[m[32m└── backend/    # FastAPI[m
[32m+[m[32m```[m
[32m+[m
